    "detailed_description": "Game System<br />\r\nThis game is a choice-based visual novel. The story and its endings change based on the player's decisions. <br />\r\nYou can unlock different storylines through various choices at critical moments. What will your choice be?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Content<br />\r\nThis game is a prequel to &quot;Glass,&quot; exploring the past and the formation of its universe. <br />\r\nIt delves into the background before the main events of the original story, set in a multi-dimensional world, <br />\r\noffering a deep understanding of the main characters' motivations and relationships. <br />\r\nIt provides fans of &quot;Glass&quot; with an opportunity to experience the story from a new perspective.",
